  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human rights for all: Equal rights and opportunities for LGBTI persons</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall goal: LGBTI people are protected from sexual and gender based violence, persecution and discrimination, and fully recognized as citizens, with equal access to education, employment, health, housing and civic participation.  
SO 1: Religious leaders and LGBTI people of faith advocate for inclusion, equal access to services and non-discrimination in Kenya and Southern Africa.
SO 2: The rights of children and youth with diverse gender identities, gender expressions, sexual orientations and sex characteristics (SOGIESC) are protected and promoted within the South and Southeast Asia Region.</narrative>
  </description>
